#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:66
msgid "VMs With Local Storage"
msgstr "VMs Con Local Storage"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:68
msgid ""
"VMs that have volumes on local datastores cannot be live-migrated. These "
"VMs must be powered off before the host enters maintenance mode. If a "
"running VM has local storage, maintenance mode will report a failure for "
"that VM and continue with the remaining VMs."
msgstr ""
"VMs ese tienen volúmenes en local datastores cannot be live-migrado. "
"Estos VMs debe be powered off antes de el host enters mantenimiento modo."
" Si un ejecutando VM tiene local storage, mantenimiento modo será report "
"un fallo para ese VM y continuar con el remaining VMs."

